[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4488281588","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119477#issuecomment-4488281588","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119477","id":4488281588,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC4W99A","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T13:34:27Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T13:34:27Z","body":"I think it should be part of the filter text input like `t:` in the scene tree instead of its own UI + you should be able to save your searches. with its own UI it won't scale well when support for other search criterias is added","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4488281588/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4489358290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119477#issuecomment-4489358290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119477","id":4489358290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC5Yr0g","user":{"login":"Quatumus","id":82884848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyODg0ODQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82884848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus","html_url":"https://github.com/Quatumus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T15:30:18Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T15:30:18Z","body":"Having the filtering be a part of the text input could also be possible and I wouldn't mind having it that way. However my personal preference is this UI. The filters do currently save between engine restarts if that is what you meant, or did you mean saving presets of searches?\r\n\r\nI think the text based search could co-exist with this UI as it would be faster for quick searches that you might only do once, but for going back and forth the UI is pretty useful with it's ability to save filters and toggle them with a single click.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4489358290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimize