 well for new filter types. Implementing only support for text would be a better start because it's smaller and doesn't need much planning","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490792952/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4493722075","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119477#issuecomment-4493722075","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119477","id":4493722075,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC9jB2w","user":{"login":"Quatumus","id":82884848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyODg0ODQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82884848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus","html_url":"https://github.com/Quatumus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quatumus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-20T01:35:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-20T01:35:28Z","body":"I changed it to a plain and boring text based filter.\r\nboth `t:` and `type:` now filter classes.\r\n\r\nIt is a lot simpler and no doubt more appealing to the poweruser workflow with typing everything out instead of navingating menus.\r\n\r\nAs for saving searches im not sure how I would go about implementing that here. Perhaps pressing up arrow when the search box is selected? However I think that could be it's own pr as it would be more general and not a part of class filtering.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"447\" height=\"162\" alt=\"kuva\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11ab3cb6-06b4-488d-af23-da618ceb5497\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4493722075/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4579338573","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119477#issuecomment-4579338573","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119477","id":4579338573,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEPMpTQ","user":{"login":"GibionMillak","id":62446430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNDQ2NDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62446430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak","html_url":"https://github.com/GibionMillak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T19:53:29Z","updated_at":"202